      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Cluster 1 shows typical SMM behavior under zero dc field. χMT at 300 K is 28.29 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 28.34 for two isolated Dy(III)); it remains nearly constant to 50 K then falls to 17.64 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, consistent with antiferromagnetic interactions and/or Stark depopulation. Magnetization reaches 4.02 Nβ at 70 kOe and 2.0 K without saturation. Frequency-dependent χ″ peaks are observed in zero dc field. Arrhenius fitting gives Ueff = 29.70 K and τ0 = 1.93 × 10−6 s (Hdc = 0 Oe). Cole–Cole α = 0.08–0.71 (7–14 K); dual relaxation appears at 2–6 K.",
